{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261120/photo/bkn-20261120151502582-1120_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261120153139\"/><p>涉事的是美軍F35B戰機；圖為同型號戰機。（Getty Images圖片）</p><p>美軍一架F35B戰機周五（20日）上午11時左右緊急降落日本高知機場，沒有影響民航飛機。目前未知戰機緊急降落原因。</p><p>在降落前，涉事F35B曾向高知機場管制部門通報緊急狀況，戰機在確認安全後緊急降落，目前停留在機場內。機場跑道並未關閉，事件沒有造成人員受傷，也未對民用飛機產生影響。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T07:44:01.740521+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":186,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:15:02+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:37:25.027620+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T07:37:26.698203+00:00","content_hash":"ecd8c9a62c9447a7e74a80b783c6eea2804915eb97c991619964ec7c9d8f8a43","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}